    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f41db2c386cbd690eb755c4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在这场比赛……！在这场“天皇赏（秋）”，\n我成功看到那片景色了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b22140e1d25446f59bb99a174dddf9e1e1afa3e556ea332236374bc3d93b0122",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
