    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eeb7f946d7c854460761198b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天皇赏（秋）结束后・超越极限",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d292074bc5c0cc6842377d0e84036be8dc859565ecb0acc401dbf5cdc9b2afb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002311.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8b041d58c1e24fff9254190",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即将面对出道战的无声铃鹿，\n在校内举办的模拟赛中展现\n惊人的“爆领”，造成极大的回响。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5be25c062939afa9af53add3d3de9202d9de6c93b1ceec8c310b97384fa3e60f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb0c617e08629fa8a2a7df7e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但她却对这些反应视而不见，\n说自己“只是想看最前方的景色而已”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4060d881d23c27e73d73be3982952cce240d3051aaf2917b0ad7651c41468996",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3946cb8e0787d39d91e3d5fe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比任何人都热爱跑步的无声铃鹿，\n就是从这里开始，\n迈向挑战速度极限的每一天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f5e5628cceb08be2ea962e3e1a261be5941fa513be5175cbbcb573beb0ccd41",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26e6ba9b28e4bb30f1b4b8ad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿登场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a544d1c5ffdc3cfdc15f535e72f23bcf3e3d88c0173e57dc6ac5c103a8d753e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0deedc043dcf09d33736db7e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿在出道战中展现“爆领”的实力，\n让世人为之轰动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bfad2a68ce3a6230be26d04c196da9ad1a7c76bd0abe0953b19f7d32f1c00af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:481216a0ffabb3325ab29c0a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽前来慰劳她的同时，\n也对训练员提出忠告，\n千万不要浪费了她的天分。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7efd2040cbfa68fa2264cc42be0dec80b91c14dabcea810df9a26f70e20ee7a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2985e3915da549b55300fc83",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员把这些话牢记在心，\n并再次下定决心要好好协助无声铃鹿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bef1cedaf665488661a10f802d6cb81cfe5adb749e4774ec638597cf11aa3a58",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fece1dcc74de068098dd657b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "战斗的揭幕",
      "source_fingerprint": "035b44ae98082faeeb14a9df5a5de28d94cdda0d15e71520ff45b0cbafb1217a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:625ac1f5423331382b8c7ce4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿在寒冬中，\n为了“弥生赏”而持续训练，\n某天受特别周所托一起陪她并跑练习。",
      "source_fingerprint": "336eca902e17ad1a55469f3aaf487d8f07c3561e9d5975d8af4cc0da294e823f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:daf3dfaf49c378c864d8c41b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爽快答应并跑练习的无声铃鹿，\n看着特别周拼命努力的样子，这才知道\n其他赛马娘们是怀抱着“梦想”在奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b29f90dbc05bad77e89edbfeb3fc6e1d727645fd2590ab4856f81fc256cb81de",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a073d7ffc0e21b126e4f3fe6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这件事不知为何……深刻牵动了她的心思，\n让无声铃鹿感到十分困惑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70647df51a8aaed46c195785ffd138dc92d7397146ec145af868ca0d6e64868d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4086c742e335648381fce67",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我奔跑的理由",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c48e9f7d0b02f3e31a22da2c18f5998badd7945cb4f44d4406257ce1a4d95c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3edc394c2750dd9206c0b46c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿在“金鯱赏”创下壮举，\n气槽称赞她成为赛马娘的崭新“理想”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2c11ad50bdfb570c88beb3b378e59b09e34385bedc4ed8b458fdb3793ba0eb2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fa6d00726144262b31151cf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽向无声铃鹿下达战帖，\n说要赌上身为“女帝”的尊严超越“理想”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b1bf47b00b7ecb1e5b4067af625cb9a910fb6d07f2e385a6fb0c118755d6de1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8e0e2790b8fe72e6d1c5798",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿和气槽，\n将在“宝冢纪念”中正式对决。",
      "source_fingerprint": "815050aaadeeaf84b218d37b0e533eb656ad140dc5c34db065dfb9d8cadf3d01",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:755b9f40c9016cad96e8c881",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“女帝”的注目眼神",
      "source_fingerprint": "00c803455a86a38c8ba4fb7d23755da33566151d810efb56d64c2f932ba36d6e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dcab9d66647626f65615add",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“宝冢纪念”结束，\n距离要参赛的“天皇赏（秋）”越来越近，\n无声铃鹿面对比赛也充满干劲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "162dcc9eb1d70b0b911373374b707eeb25916c09b893cd3f246356832f55bd61",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
