    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d13b4b6e098d6e758819d38",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在这段期间，\n她为了下次要参赛的“每日王冠”\n每天不断努力训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de677723b043f3a07116a95c91941d1ff677dc2d28c78e922575fc8a5694bea4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ec2a47c30f15f4749549428",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神鹰和草上飞也都等不及\n之后要和无声铃鹿对决的比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ffbe2695f021240b75d7584dc26a9cb71eba75fff2b98e2e55186017c068ad3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9291cfd47655ce6dedbb89ff",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在“每日王冠”的比赛中……\n首屈一指的赛马娘们，\n将跨越世代彼此较量！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f48e1a028089472b0b7eb9dc26036a3e988948c4bb498a65ab32cfcfc83f9d2d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d7dd2bb09d4a704490f942c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想超越的那道“光”",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d54edc1a95eb63a0dd183142b6e7c75a02a1b60b898d2b7cf2801588a30770b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86a5f20827af1469ab45d8d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿为了“天皇赏（秋）”不断努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "faa59d3f63cb17968e30fed628907bfa43b794b68274c1768b746b8d87b2fad4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5590601452b8770f14f30c54",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而，她的身体跟不上已达到极限的速度，\n让无声铃鹿的脚开始感到疼痛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "411c41572c0a3bdfef3be1c4bcade12ae1f144c9c80c52196285e843c15112e8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06bc9b27558d7fdf9a1173e5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "特别周担心她的脚，\n建议无声铃鹿还是放弃参加天皇赏会比较好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60f96d67d6ad80386da8f3646373dc054184047ef3640ee84ab7720214fc628c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c68a5413c5d40c86626ecd9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使听到她这么说，\n无声铃鹿仍是坚定自己的意志，\n下定决心宣告出赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad7322899475d41f4e6b4c66f5f507270a807cdc43f0f50905565c3119c75b38",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1dc216a40298e5e8825ee1b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "绝不退让的意志",
      "source_fingerprint": "71ebf873d9d91f29929dcadc7864bb77acdc930975c2771a97eef1121596780b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dc5cc4ea4ce2db2c4fc2e69",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“天皇赏（秋）”结束……\n无声铃鹿为了还能继续奔跑，\n告诉训练员说她会专心疗伤。",
      "source_fingerprint": "27b9db398ebe9f50fda216f83b1fde262c2437293099c9a207dd4f95cdfd4bf2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f263587f78de8bcaaea597f9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "原以为就算强硬阻止，\n她仍会坚持继续参赛，\n训练员对她改变想法的事惊讶不已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0a6c0751f64c477f6d8e5e21527d13303d825c39caf20346e3a54bcfdcefb39",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:865a0811f4cad8796fd601c6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿表示，\n自己能在“天皇赏（秋）”跑到最后，\n都是因为有训练员那席话，所以对他全心信赖。",
      "source_fingerprint": "206da7ef71dc9b10569dbd1c3ffd9d1efdbff6184542c76f1f6f4c9d5fa7813b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e043c0ea29190e862339847",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿对训练员说，\n希望未来也能继续一起欣赏领先的景色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0702d105812bc7bb9f91504bf11aacccc7695e0586f47e876c2db0d0d0c69d8c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64d6bc37554d0f95908e3844",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "再往更前方",
      "source_fingerprint": "032ac1e0cc49b8c56787218bc67756a6000aeb3c9f7c408f645c5f81ed73ac96",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:223ef9522c4fc6f7f325edd1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“弥生赏”结束后不久……\n来到赛马娘们参加集训的季节。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9eba61bac7803780464fb89af1660be54371181a182d4408d7730976152c141e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ab990ae4809cfa7ec5d853d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿认为自己必须更加快速，\n但双脚却越来越沉重，\n因此烦恼不已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bc89bee55112be658e544a8a5f9968623595cdbf6948b37cdd44e336cdaa7d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:708b19a83ca8e7c334ed3b6e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我和那样的她展开了不安的夏季集训。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f8f504034665b758013dedb57e843e8385f9a740a4443d5ce4c5c5f0997c9f2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8c7b63a2cce7ca3f95d34a3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第二年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e193ad94ba56712a8e92ed87a15587d1a6af48670f61e354efcb818a0837f0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002407.json",
      "json_path": [
